WEBVTT

00:08:25.276 --> 00:08:31.516
And the hope is that this type
of change will not be linear

00:08:31.556 --> 00:08:34.316
but instead follow
a more exponential path.

00:08:35.476 --> 00:08:37.276
As Zou Ji noted,

00:08:37.316 --> 00:08:40.476
transformation might seem
slow in the beginning,

00:08:40.516 --> 00:08:43.236
like turning around a giant ship.

00:08:43.956 --> 00:08:46.156
But once the head is turned,

00:08:46.196 --> 00:08:49.796
actions can accelerate
in the right direction

00:08:49.796 --> 00:08:52.156
at an unprecedented speed.

00:08:52.516 --> 00:08:53.716
Thank you.

00:08:53.756 --> 00:08:59.836
(Applause)